  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Differ Community Power - Scaling Clean Energy business and jobs in MalawI. Feasibility studies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Differ Community Power, a daughtercompany of Differ AS, has ca 60 off grid health facilities and schools in operation in Malawi. This project will investigate the opportunities of business development related to existing activities (feasibility studies), to: 
1) Utilize excess energy from oversized PV capacity to generate revenues for health facilities to ensure operations and maintainance (by testing Energy HUB and Water HUB)
2) Explore options to install solar energy systems to replace generators or unstable grid for farming and other businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
